  "sop_page_text": "02 \u2014 Purpose This document describes the complete workflow followed by the Techpack Automation system to automatically generate a Licensing Sheet. It explains both the user interaction and the internal system processes required to retrieve production information, validate production assets, and generate the Licensing Sheet. Every production standard described in this document is required for the automation to function correctly. 03 \u2014 Automation Overview The Licensing Sheet is generated automatically by combining information from multiple standardized production sources. The system retrieves information from: Master Data Product Library Production Server SKU Folder Artwork Mockup Packaging Every asset must follow the approved Production Standards. 04 \u2014 Step 1: Open the Application User Action \u2014 The Technical Designer opens the Techpack Automation application. System Process \u2014 The application loads Master Data, Product Library, System Configuration, and the Production Server Path. The system verifies that all required databases are available. If one of them cannot be accessed, the process stops."
